On this page, you'll upload {{ v.docs_noun_long | default(v.docs_noun) }} (PDFs) to a Unity Catalog Volume and connect them to Genie Agent to answer questions that require both documents and data.

| Question | From documents | From Metric View |
|---|---|---|
{% for q in v.questions %}
| {{ q.summary }} | {{ q.from_docs }} | {{ q.from_data }} |
